# Public repository: documentation, result image, and the Windows download.
# Everything else stays local, including Python sources and source archives.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/software/
!/docs/

# Only publish the image used by the READMEs from the docs folder.
/docs/*
!/docs/images/
/docs/images/*
!/docs/images/final-results.png

# The software folder has its own list of files to publish.
